# Options
#
FpOptionsTitle=Factura Pública options
FpOptAttachPdf=Attach the invoice PDF to the Facturae file
FpOptAttachPdfHelp=FACe accepts it and many public bodies like it. Remove it if the file goes over 10 MB.
FpOptTsa=Timestamp (optional)
FpOptTsaHelp=Address of a timestamping server (TSA). Leave it empty if you do not need it.
FpOptVfMode=VERI*FACTU check URL
FpOptVfModeHelp=Your billing system creates the VERI*FACTU QR code URL. When the invoice carries it, Factura Pública copies it unchanged into the Facturae file as its own field, as Orden HAC/1177/2024 requires. It never computes it, never creates VERI*FACTU records and never sends anything to the AEAT.
FpOptVfNone=Do not include
FpOptVfAuto=Copy it automatically when the invoice has one
FpOptVfField=Copy it from a specific invoice field
FpOptVfFieldPick=Invoice field holding the URL
FpOptVfNoFields=Your invoices have no extra fields.
FpOptVfPlace=Where it goes in the file
FpOptVfPlaceAdditional=Invoice additional data
FpOptSplit=Split series and number
FpOptSplitHelp=If your refs look like FA2611-0042, send "FA2611" as the series and "0042" as the number. Otherwise the whole ref is the number.
FpOptNotify=Email for FACe notices
FpOptNotifyHelp=FACe writes here when an invoice changes status. Left empty, we use yours or the company's.
FpOptExemptOwn=None: ask on each line
FpOptExempt=Default exemption reason
FpOptExemptHelp=Used on lines without VAT that have no reason of their own.
