FpAboutIntro=Factura Pública turns your validated Dolibarr invoices into signed Facturae 3.2.2, sends them to FACe and tracks their status until you are paid.
FpAboutNot=Factura Pública does not issue invoices or create VERI*FACTU records: it reads the invoices your software has already issued and never changes them.
